# Search: why did the token refresh fail

*8 matches in 2 sessions, `[ROOT]/work/app`*

## 1. Fix token refresh

`aaaa1111` · 2026-01-01 10:00 – 2026-01-01 10:07 · turns 0–5 · 6 matches in turns 0, 1, 2, 4, 5

**#0 👤 User · 2026-01-01 10:00** · `claudegrep read aaaa1111 --from 0.0`

